  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEAQE Mali-Ed. govt authorities and head teachers have capacity built</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education policies,plans and practices promote equality and inclusion: Local government has increased understanding of and commitment to equality and inclusion; Head teachers manage teachers effectively; Local education government authorities have increased their monitoring and coordination of schools.</narrative>
